invariant chosenAt(R1, V) & le(R1, R2) & proposal(R2, V2) -> V = V2

invariant one_b_max_vote(N, R1, R2, V1) & one_b_max_vote(N, R1, R3, V2) -> (R2 = negone & R3 = negone) | (R2 = R3 & V1 = V2)

invariant chosenAt(R, V) & proposal(R, V2) -> V = V2

invariant vote(N, R, V) & proposal(R, V2) -> V = V2

invariant proposal(R1, V1) & proposal(R2, V2) & le(R1, R2) & R1 ~= R2 -> V1 = V2

